* Independently written two-stage amplifier with switched feedback and signal path.
.subckt MULTI IN CTRL OUT
E1 STAGE1 0 IN FB1 1000
SFB1 STAGE1 FB1 CTRL 0 MODE
RFB1 FB1 0 1k
SSIGNAL STAGE1 MID CTRL 0 MODE
RMID MID 0 2k
E2 STAGE2 0 MID FB2 1000
SFB2 STAGE2 FB2 CTRL 0 MODE
RFB2 FB2 0 1k
ESCALE OUT 0 STAGE2 0 1e6
.model MODE VSWITCH(RON=100 ROFF=10000 VON=.2 VOFF=0)
.ends MULTI
